<article class="helios-journal-story"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=journal-world-of-helios-1">← World of Helios</a><h1>THIS HALLOWEEN, HELIOS BRINGS YOU SOMETHING EXCITING</h1><div class="helios-journal-story__body rte">
         

<div>Table of Contents 
  
</div>
<div></div>
<div><p><span>“Men don’t grow up, they just get bigger toys.”</span></p>
<p><span>That witty saying partly reflects the familiar interests of men. As children, joy may come from model cars, building block sets, or simple toys. As adults, those interests gradually change, giving way to gaming PCs, motorcycles, cameras, or other tech gadgets. Even as life brings more responsibilities, curiosity, the thrill of discovery, and the joy of creating something of one’s own remain intact.</span></p>
<p><span>These items do not merely serve personal interests; they also provide a relaxing escape where men can temporarily set aside the daily grind, relieve the pressures of life, and nurture their inner child. </span></p>
<p><span>With that spirit in mind, for this year’s Halloween, HELIOS is experimenting for the first time with combining handcrafted silver jewelry with the world of building block toys. </span><strong><span>Withered Jack Pendant</span></strong><span> was created as a pendant that can be combined with a mini figure body, allowing the owner to freely change the character’s appearance and create Jack versions in their own unique style.</span></p>
<p><span>A piece of silver made to be worn, but also opening up fun new ways to play.</span></p>
<p><span><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/DSC00199.jpg?v=1792771552" alt="" loading="lazy" width="64" height="80"></span></p>
<h2>BLACK HALLOWEEN</h2>
<p><span>Pumpkins are an iconic symbol of Halloween. Faces with hollowed-out eyes and mouths, illuminated from within, have become a recognizable part of the holiday. But with Withered Jack, HELIOS has opted against the full, rounded appearance typically associated with a decorative pumpkin.</span></p>
<p><span>Instead, it takes the form of a withered pumpkin, bearing the marks of decay and distortion over time.</span></p>
<p><span>The pumpkin stem is retained as a sign of its original form. Hollow eye sockets, a crooked smile, and a hinged jaw give Jack an unusual expression—one that is both familiar to Halloween imagery and distinctly eerie.</span></p>
<p><span>Another detail HELIOS incorporated into the design is the Lotus symbol in the eye socket, a signature that has appeared on many of the brand’s creations. Amidst the overall form of a distorted pumpkin, the Lotus creates a distinctive identifier that links Jack to HELIOS’s design language.</span></p>
<p><span>The entire figure is crafted from S925 silver and finished by hand. Recessed areas, engraved lines, and layered surfaces create more pronounced contrasts between light and shadow. Silver catches the light on the raised parts, while dark grooves emphasize the withered texture and the depth of the face.</span></p>
<p><span>It is this treatment of form and surface that gives Jack an edgy appearance, unlike Halloween imagery typically rendered in bright colors or with playful expressions.</span></p>
<p><span>But HELIOS did not want to limit Withered Jack to a design meant only for wearing.</span></p>
<p><span><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/Thi_t_k_ch_a_co_ten-51.png?v=1792771886" alt="" loading="lazy" width="64" height="80"></span></p>
<h2><span>HELIOS INTRODUCES JEWELRY TO THE WORLD OF BUILDING BLOCK TOYS FOR THE FIRST TIME</span></h2>
<p><span>Building block toys have a special appeal: from a set of available parts, players can decide the final form. Changing a small detail can sometimes be enough to create an entirely different character, appearance, or story.</span></p>
<p><span>HELIOS found an exciting possibility for Withered Jack in this.</span></p>
<p><span>Instead of appearing only on a chain, Jack’s silver head can also be combined with a compatible mini figure body. With just a few simple assembly steps, a piece of jewelry can become the head of a miniature character.</span></p>
<p><span>This gives the owner more choices in how Jack appears.</span></p>
<p><span>A different outfit can give Jack a completely new look. By changing the body, accessories, or the character’s setting, players have even more ways to express their creativity. Jack can appear in a display corner, take part in scenes carefully arranged by the owner, and then become a familiar pendant again when worn.</span></p>
<p><span>This versatility is what makes the design so compelling. HELIOS created Jack’s silver head but did not predetermine all the forms the character could take. Part of the experience is left to the owner, allowing them to discover combinations based on their own interests and imagination.</span></p>
<p><span>No matter how it appears, the silver head remains the centerpiece of the design. Jack’s engraved details, surface texture, and distinctive face are preserved, while the figure body opens up different creative possibilities.</span></p>
<p><span>A piece of silver with a fixed form, but with no need to limit how you play.</span></p>
<p><span><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/hlw_concept-2-5.jpg?v=1792771987" alt="" loading="lazy" width="64" height="96"></span></p>
<h2><span>MADE TO WEAR, READY TO PLAY.</span></h2>
<p><span>The idea of combining jewelry with a figure reflects a broader perspective on the items we choose as adults.</span></p>
<p><span>Jewelry is often associated with personal style, aesthetics, or meanings that the wearer wishes to preserve. Toys, on the other hand, evoke curiosity, the joy of discovery, and the creativity we sometimes spend less time exploring as we grow up.</span></p>
<p><span>With the Withered Jack Pendant, HELIOS brings these two experiences together.</span></p>
<p><span>It is a pendant crafted from S925 silver, featuring the brand’s signature design language and Halloween spirit. At the same time, it is a design that allows the owner to assemble, modify, and create character versions of their own choosing.</span></p>
<p><span>This combination does not change Withered Jack’s nature as a handcrafted silver piece of jewelry. Instead, it expands how a piece of silver can exist in everyday life, moving beyond its function as an outfit accent to become an object that can be interacted with and used for creative play.</span></p>
<p><span>Halloween is also the perfect time to experiment with this. As eerie imagery is embraced with greater freedom, a withered pumpkin with a distorted face can easily become a character in a world created by the owner themselves.</span><span></span></p>
<p><strong><span>“Made to wear, Ready to play.”</span></strong><span>, Withered Jack is made to be worn, but is always ready for another kind of play.</span></p>
<p><span><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/DSC01362.jpg?v=1792772096" alt="" loading="lazy" width="64" height="80"></span></p>
<p><span>HELIOS provides Jack’s silver head and his signature features. What form Jack takes, where he appears, and what story he is part of is up to each person’s choice.</span></p>
<p><span>And perhaps that is the most exciting thing about childhood toys meeting the adult world: the joy of creativity remains intact, only now we have new materials and ways to express it.</span></p>
<p><strong><span>JACK GOES WITH YOU.</span></strong></p></div>
  

